OL,5,G1700 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FAt a B&B in Enniskillen, the
OL,7,     Fguests are all poised for some
OL,8,     Fchillin'. But host Shaun's
OL,9,     Fbreakfast boasts, about bacon and
OL,10,     Ftoast, may leave him cast as the
OL,11,     Fvillain. #NationalPoetryDay
OL,12,G1730 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FIn Bedfordshire and Cambridgeshire
OL,14,     Fit's Shane's turn to host, with
OL,15,     FJamaican food and a gin martini
OL,16,     Ftoast. Clean plates all round;
OL,17,     Fwill he bag the thousand pounds?
OL,18,     F(Ep4/5) #NationalPoetryDay
